# Investor Demo Stack — Auth Bypass, Docker Seed, Root Compose

## Overview

Make CODEFLOW demo-ready for investor presentations. Single `docker compose up` from repo root starts full stack (ClickHouse + NATS + Go API + seed data + Next.js dashboard). Dashboard bypasses WorkOS auth in dev mode. CLI syncs live events to local cloud.

**Problem:** Dashboard middleware throws 500 without WorkOS credentials. Seed script can't run on Windows. No unified launch command.

**Brainstorm report:** [brainstorm-260605-investor-demo-readiness.md](../reports/brainstorm-260605-investor-demo-readiness.md)

